3	# Contract — DRAFT, NOT FROZEN
4	
5	Derived from the demo-script build list. The contract-freeze lead freezes
6	it once the demo script is frozen (route picked). Until then teammates can
7	code against it but must expect field names to move.
8	
9	## Shared types
10	
11	```ts
12	type Station = { evaNumber: string; name: string };
13	
14	type Leg = {
15	  trainId: string;            // e.g. "ICE 75"
16	  from: Station;
17	  to: Station;
18	  plannedDeparture: string;   // ISO 8601, local time with offset
19	  plannedArrival: string;
20	  transferMinutes?: number;   // planned transfer to the next leg
21	};
22	
23	type Journey = { id: string; legs: Leg[]; source: "db-share" | "manual" | "seed" };
24	
25	type Explained<T> = {
26	  value: T;
27	  reasoning: string;          // one paragraph, human-readable
28	  sources: string[];          // data windows, feeds, model id
29	  confidence: "low" | "medium" | "high";   // advisory, not calibrated
30	};
31	
32	type LegDelay = {
33	  trainId: string;
34	  expectedDelayMinutes: Explained<number>;
35	  missProbability: Explained<number>;      // 0..1, chance this transfer breaks
36	};
37	
38	type Prediction = {
39	  journeyId: string;
40	  legs: LegDelay[];
41	  planFailProbability: Explained<number>;  // 0..1, chained across legs
42	  modelId: string;                          // fine-tuned model version
43	};
44	
45	type Recommendation = {
46	  verdict: "good" | "add-buffer" | "take-alternative";
47	  advice: Explained<string>;               // "take an umbrella" language
48	  bufferMinutes?: number;
49	  alternative?: Journey;                   // comfortable connection, if any
50	};
51	```
52	
53	## API surface (backend, Node, `/api`)
54	
55	| Method | Path | Body → Response | Feature |
56	|---|---|---|---|
57	| GET | `/api/health` | → `{ ok: true }` | backend |
58	| POST | `/api/journeys/parse` | `{ text: string }` → `Journey` (400 if no connection found) | share-parser |
59	| POST | `/api/predict` | `Journey` → `Prediction` | delay-prediction |
60	| POST | `/api/recommend` | `{ journey: Journey; prediction: Prediction }` → `Recommendation` | recommendation |
61	| GET | `/api/seed/demo` | → `Journey` for the storyline route (offline fallback) | pwa-shell |
62	
63	## Mocks until real
64	
65	- `/api/predict` returns fixed per-leg delays for the seed journey until the fine-tuned model is served.
66	- `/api/recommend` returns a canned "take-alternative" for the seed journey until the algorithm exists.
67	
68	Freezing this contract requires stopping the team and getting sign-off.
